  (text "DATA / CONTROL\nGPIO2/3 I2C -> U2 0x40 / U3 0x41 -> 21 PWM sinks\nGPIO10/11/18 -> 3 spotlight PWM; GPIO6/7 -> CAN\nGPIO0 AND ARM AND READY -> SAFE\nTMP112 0x48; J18 GPIO19-23 / 3V3\nStrap probes: GPIO4/5/15; USB12/13; UART16/17"
